{
  "id": "poem-047",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">待最后一缕香散尽于虚空</span><span class=\"poem-line\">待最后一滴茶汤饮用入喉</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">达味觉与嗅觉高潮</span><span class=\"poem-line\">寂静的天空挂圆月</span><span class=\"poem-line\">所有思念从这一刻</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">戛然而止</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-4\"><span class=\"poem-line\">漫天花雨</span><span class=\"poem-line\">芬芳美丽</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/047.webp\" data-caption=\"《香》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《香》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/047.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《香》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《香》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 47 页</p>"
}
